1
00:00:00,379 --> 00:00:03,549
(Sheldon:)...exhausted by your constant tomfoolery.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:05,470
(Raj:)But it's true.

3
00:00:05,635 --> 00:00:07,515
[SNORTS]

4
00:00:08,804 --> 00:00:11,474
(Raj:)We put all your vital information
into this dating site...

5
00:00:11,641 --> 00:00:14,981
...answered all questions like you would
and they found a match for you.

6
00:00:15,144 --> 00:00:18,274
(Raj:)-Her name is Amy Farrah Fowler.
-Please.

7
00:00:18,439 --> 00:00:21,319
(Sheldon:)Even assuming you could answer
any question the way I would...

8
00:00:21,484 --> 00:00:24,404
(Sheldon:)...the algorithms used
by matchmaking sites are complete hokum.

9
00:00:24,570 --> 00:00:26,530
That's the answer
we gave to the question.

10
00:00:26,697 --> 00:00:28,787
"What is your attitude
towards online dating?"

11
00:00:29,241 --> 00:00:32,581
Well, Howard wanted to write
"mumbo jumbo," but I said no.

12
00:00:32,745 --> 00:00:36,085
Our Sheldon would say "hokum."

13
00:00:38,584 --> 00:00:40,834
(Leonard:)Come on,
where's your scientific curiosity?

14
00:00:41,003 --> 00:00:43,923
Most of it is being applied to unraveling
secrets of universe...

15
00:00:44,090 --> 00:00:47,720
...while the rest of it is wondering why
I'm having this conversation with you.

16
00:00:47,885 --> 00:00:49,425
Okay, how about this?

17
00:00:49,595 --> 00:00:52,935
(Raj:)Even Spock had a date
once every seven years.

18
00:00:53,099 --> 00:00:55,229
(Sheldon:)He didn't date. It was pon farr.

19
00:00:55,393 --> 00:00:57,813
(Sheldon:)His blood boiled with mating lust.

20
00:00:58,729 --> 00:01:00,689
(Howard:)Why don't you start
with a cup of coffee...

